=== 2026-09-11 (scheduled run, FAILED, nothing published) ===
The Windows Task Scheduler job fired at 09:20 and exited 1 before writing anything:
"could not find claude.exe". The Claude app is an MSIX package, so its CLI lives in the
app's virtualised AppData, which an outside Task Scheduler process cannot see.

Fixed the same day: the Windows task and its two runner scripts are removed, and the run
now lives in the Claude app as the scheduled task "Catalyst Method weekly blogs",
next run 18 September 07:03. Week 2 of CONTENT-PLAN.md is still queued, untouched.

